    "diagnosis": "<p>Neuroendocrine tumour (NET)</p>",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "<p>Type&nbsp;1 enterochromaffin-like&ndash;cell (ECL-cell) NETs arise in a background of atrophic gastritis showing pseudopyloric and intestinal metaplasia (upper-left corner); tumour cells form a microlobular architecture without necrosis and show monomorphic nuclei lacking nucleoli.</p>",
    "source": "Stefano La Rosa",
    "copyright": "",
