    "diagnosis": "<p>Neuroendocrine tumour (NET)</p>",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "<p>In type 2 ECL-cell NETs, peritumoural mucosa is not atrophic; this case is characterized by a proliferation of well-differentiated monomorphic cells with eosinophilic cytoplasm forming trabeculae and ribbons associated with extracellular mucoid-like material.&nbsp;</p>",
    "source": "Guido Rindi",
    "copyright": "",
