    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "<p>Gastric mixed adenoneuroendocrine carcinoma (MANEC)</p>",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "<p><strong>A</strong>&nbsp;MANEC of the cardial region, composed of adenocarcinoma (left part of the image) and large cell neuroendocrine carcinoma (LCNEC; right part of the image). <strong>B</strong>&nbsp;Immunohistochemical staining for chromogranin shows diffuse and strong cytoplasm immunoreactivity in the neuroendocrine component, whereas it is negative in the adenocarcinoma. <strong>C</strong>&nbsp;The neuroendocrine component is also positive for synaptophysin. <strong>D</strong>&nbsp;High Ki-67 proliferation index of the neuroendocrine component is the most important prognostic marker of MANEC {29592868}.</p>",
